			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Element submodule to latest\n\nUpdate Element submodule from dbe3e3b7 to adeecb7f, forward-syncing the Cocoon extension host to commit 2ecb1ad.\n\nThis brings the latest upstream extension host changes into the Land editor build.",
			"SHA": "d0c5e60ceea16a4b9fdaabd93e79b97021b4aa39"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-27T21:27:35Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				102,
				2
			],
			"Message": "feat(Project): Complete webview-view lifecycle, patch terminal backend, stabilize PostHog ID\n\nSubmodule synchronization bringing three major improvements:\n\n1. Webview Notification Channels (Mountain + Sky + Output):\n   - Mountain adds `cocoon:notify` handler for fire-and-forget one-way methods (webview.message, webview.dispose, webview.viewState) bypassing 30s timeout\n   - Extends notification relay to handle `webview.updateView` and `webview.reveal` in addition to setTitle/setIconPath/setHtml\n   - Sky adds `sky://webview/updateView` handler completing full lifecycle: register → resolve → set-html → update-metadata → communicate → dispose\n   - Output exposes IWebviewViewService on globalThis.__CEL_SERVICES__.WebviewViews for extension sidebar/panel webviews\n\n2. Terminal Backend Patch (Output):\n   - Add PatchLocalTerminalBackend transform bypassing Electron's acquirePort that hangs under Tauri/WKWebView\n   - Routes pty operations through existing _localPtyService channel proxy\n   - Fixes terminal createProcess/attachToProcess calls that previously hung forever\n\n3. PostHog Identifier Stability (Sky + Wind):\n   - Sky adds GetOrCreateSkyIdentifier() generating persistent `land-dev-sky-{8-char-random}` stored in localStorage\n   - Wind fixes fallback to use username from USER/USERNAME env vars instead of Date.now()\n   - Ensures consistent device tracking across editor sessions\n\nAlso updates .env.Land.PostHog.Sample to clarify distinct ID configuration for correlating events across Mountain/Cocoon/Wind/Sky tiers.\n\nImpact: Extension webview panels now render correctly, terminal PTYs spawn under Tauri, and telemetry correctly tracks unique users/devices.",
			"SHA": "738bdc40ae53652ddf407caa28c75fc072e54fb7"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-27T21:03:57Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				102,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Element submodule to latest\n\nUpdate Element submodule from 6f11cad3 to 271252d9, bringing webview.setHtml channel alignment fix:\n- Mountain adds suffix mapping to translate VS Code's camelCase `webview.setHtml` to Sky's canonical kebab-case `set-html` channel\n- Sky adds handlers for `sky://webview/set-html` and `sky://webview/postMessage` to complete the webview-view lifecycle\n- This is the final piece of the channel alignment series (following Terminal, Debug, StatusBar, Progress, Output)\n\nImpact: Extensions like GitLens can now properly render their sidebar panels in the Land editor.",
			"SHA": "7dd86ffca9c561c0edb507a4d4d6af6c39806330"
		}
